      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَّاجٌ</span></b>  One <i>who often removes, clears away,</i> or
<i>dispels, grief,</i> or <i>anxiety, from those affected therewith;</i> or <i>who does so much.</i> (O.)

